  "limitations": [
    "Configured-target selection is independently readable, including physical fan-button preset changes and restored Auto zero, but the fan ACKs and configured-target getter do not prove physical speed, tachometer state, active mode, or ownership.",
    "The two cooling-mode getter selectors expose stored firmware and Synapse configuration banks. Neither selector identifies which bank currently drives the fan.",
    "The 18-slot logical strip order is known. Physical origin and direction remain unassigned and must not be claimed; logical whole-strip rendering does not require that claim.",
    "The exact vendor Fixed and Auto payloads are now assigned, but the earlier OpenBlade replay failure proves that encoding and status-02 echo alone are insufficient for production write admission."
